OL,3,ACleveland police chief proud of force
OL,4,Abut being 'let down' by funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said her officers are dealing with
OL,7,Fsome of the highest crime levels in the
OL,8,Fcountry akin to those faced by
OL,9,Fmetropolitan forces, but with less than
OL,10,Fhalf the number of officers.
OL,12,FMultiple people have since been
OL,13,Farrested as part of a wider police
OL,14,Foperation against organised crime
OL,15,Ffollowing the crash.
